This work covers the manuscript (P18_revised.pdf) and the CSV data files in csv/. You may share and adapt the material for any purpose, including commercially, provided you give appropriate credit, link to the licence, and indicate whether changes were made.

The CSV data were reduced from the Illustris-1-Dark simulation (Nelson et al. 2015). The published article (Scientific Reports 13, 16531, 2023) is the version of record.
